body:
The research of #3351 is done. It folds this issue in. The research comment above is the specification of the `Taper` tip form. The sub-issues of #3351 do its slices:

- slice 1, slice 5 and slice 6 (model, file, dialog, catalogue, MCP): #3368;
- slice 2 (stock simulation): #3371;
- slice 3 (verification laws): #3370;
- slice 4 (Chamfer2D and Deburr offsets and depths): #3373.

The sub-issues are `P4`. This issue keeps its labels. The maintainer decides if it closes as a duplicate of the sub-issues.
